      "role": "user",
      "content": "Hey, can you help me draft a performance review for one of my Senior Account Executives? I need it to look professional. \n\nThe good stuff: they've been doing great with client retention and keeping our main accounts happy. \n\nThe area for improvement: they've been pretty inconsistent with showing up on time for our internal morning stand-ups. It's starting to affect the team. \n\nCan you write a draft that is constructive but firm?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
